title: The Left
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: never
on-arrival: month_activities += 1; left_timer += 6
card-image: img/portraits/LeviPaul.jpg

The Left faction is the fire that drives our party forwards. How shall we make use of their talents?

-	@use_crispien: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Arthur Crispien
-	@use_levi: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Paul Levi
-	@use_sender: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Toni Sender
-	@use_rosenfeld: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Kurt Rosenfeld
-	@use_seydewitz: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Max Seydewitz
-	@use_siemsen: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Anna Siemsen
-	@use_hirschfeld: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Magnus Hirschfeld
-	@use_radbruch: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Gustav Radbruch
-	@use_stampfer: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Friedrich Stampfer
- @use_lobe: We will use the talents of the Left leader, Paul Löbe
- @boost_left_influence_subtle: We will subtly promote the Left faction as not to anger any of the other factions.
- @boost_left_influence_blatant: We will openly promote the Left faction.
- @youth: We will use the Left’s connections to boost youth recruitment to the party.
- @left_relations: We will use the Left’s connections to further relations with the left-wing parties.
- @reduce_left_dissent: We will work to reduce dissent within the faction.
- @new_left_leader: [+ left_leader +] has served well, but new leadership is required.
- @root: We will do none of these things.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@use_lobe
view-if: left_leader == "Löbe"
go-to: lobe

@use_crispien
view-if: left_leader == "Crispien"
go-to: crispien

@use_levi
view-if: left_leader == "Levi"
go-to: levi

@use_sender
view-if: left_leader == "Sender"
go-to: sender

@use_rosenfeld
view-if: left_leader == "Rosenfeld"
go-to: rosenfeld

@use_seydewitz
view-if: left_leader == "Seydewitz"
go-to: seydewitz

@use_siemsen
view-if: left_leader == "Siemsen"
go-to: siemsen

@use_hirschfeld
view-if: left_leader == "Hirschfeld"
go-to: hirschfeld

@use_radbruch
view-if: left_leader == "Radbruch"
go-to: radbruch

@use_stampfer
view-if: left_leader == "Stampfer"
go-to: stampfer

@boost_left_influence_subtle
on-arrival: left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 3

We have made subtle moves to boost the popularity of the Left faction.

@boost_left_influence_blatant
on-arrival: left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 5; center_dissent += 3; labor_dissent += 3; reformist_dissent += 3

We have openly promoted the Left faction, to the anger of the other factions.

@youth
on-arrival: rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.02; young_socialists += 1; left_strength += 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

We have used the Left’s connections to improve youth recruitment. Our new youth members flock to the left or neorevisionist wings of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the Reichsbanner.

@left_relations
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 10 ; sapd_relation += 10

We have used the Left’s connections to boost relations with the [+ uspd_name +] [? if sapd_consolidated == 1 : and the SAPD ?].

@reduce_left_dissent
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 10

We have worked to reduce dissent within the Left faction.

@new_left_leader

We must now select a new leader for the Left Faction.

- @left_leader_crispien
- @left_leader_levi
- @left_leader_rosenfeld
- @left_leader_seydewitz
- @left_leader_sender
- @left_leader_siemsen
- @left_leader_hirschfeld
- @left_leader_radbruch
- @left_leader_stampfer
- @left_leader_lobe
- @root: We have changed our minds.
- @easy_discard: We will consider this at a later time.

@left_leader_levi
title: Paul Levi
subtitle: Paul Levi is a former KPD leader who was purged for criticizing Communist policies.
view-if: left_leader != "Levi" and spd_coleader_1 != "Levi" and spd_coleader_2 != "Levi" and spd_coleader_3 != "Levi"
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/LeviPaul.jpg
on-arrival: left_leader = "Levi"; left_leader_fullname = "Paul Levi"
go-to: death_of_levi if succession_levi == 1; death_of_muller if succession_muller == 1

Paul Levi has been agreed as faction leader.

@left_leader_siemsen
title: Anna Siemsen
subtitle: Anna Siemsen is an and educational reform advocate and pacifist, who was one of the few German women to receive a PhD in the pre-war period.
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/SiemsenAnna.jpg
view-if: left_leader != "Siemsen" and spd_coleader_1 != "Siemsen" and spd_coleader_2 != "Siemsen" and spd_coleader_3 != "Siemsen"
on-arrival: left_leader = "Siemsen"; left_leader_fullname = "Anna Siemsen"
go-to: death_of_levi if succession_levi == 1; death_of_muller if succession_muller == 1

Anna Siemsen has been agreed as faction leader.

@left_leader_crispien
title: Arthur Crispien
subtitle: Arthur Crispien is a former USPD member who was purged for opposing the merger between the USPD and KPD.
